    dict(key='11-act-2-1', kind='console', title='Act Two — The files now, and the whole history',
         body='TWO. The files now, and the whole history.\n  THE REPOSITORY (5 commits):\n    commit 1  first version of the payments service\n    commit 2  deploy script\n    commit 3  build on every push\n    commit 4  remove the secrets from the files\n    commit 5  store the key in a Kubernetes Secret',
         narration='Here is the real output. [[slnc 400]] The repository: five commits, and commit four removes the secrets from the files.'),
